# VS Code Keyboard Shortcuts - Windows

## General

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Command Palette | `Ctrl + Shift + P` |
| Quick Open (Go to File) | `Ctrl + P` |
| New File | `Ctrl + N` |
| Open File | `Ctrl + O` |
| Save | `Ctrl + S` |
| Save All | `Ctrl + K, S` |
| Close File | `Ctrl + W` |
| Close Window | `Ctrl + Shift + W` |
| Settings | `Ctrl + ,` |
| Keyboard Shortcuts | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + S` |
| User Snippets | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + S` |
| Toggle Full Screen | `F11` |
| Toggle Zen Mode | `Ctrl + K, Z` |

## Editing

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Cut | `Ctrl + X` |
| Copy | `Ctrl + C` |
| Paste | `Ctrl + V` |
| Undo | `Ctrl + Z` |
| Redo | `Ctrl + Y` |
| Find | `Ctrl + F` |
| Replace | `Ctrl + H` |
| Find in Files | `Ctrl + Shift + F` |
| Replace in Files | `Ctrl + Shift + H` |
| Select All | `Ctrl + A` |
| Select Current Line | `Ctrl + L` |
| Copy Line Up | `Shift + Alt + Up` |
| Copy Line Down | `Shift + Alt + Down` |
| Move Line Up | `Alt + Up` |
| Move Line Down | `Alt + Down` |
| Delete Line | `Ctrl + Shift + K` |
| Insert Line Below | `Ctrl + Enter` |
| Insert Line Above | `Ctrl + Shift + Enter` |
| Toggle Line Comment | `Ctrl + /` |
| Toggle Block Comment | `Shift + Alt + A` |
| Format Document | `Shift + Alt + F` |
| Format Selection | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + F` |
| Go to Line | `Ctrl + G` |
| Go to Symbol in File | `Ctrl + Shift + O` |
| Go to Symbol in Workspace | `Ctrl + T` |
| Go to Definition | `F12` |
| Peek Definition | `Alt + F12` |
| Go to References | `Shift + F12` |
| Rename Symbol | `F2` |
| Trim Trailing Whitespace | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + X` |
| Change File Language | `Ctrl + K, M` |

## Navigation

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Go Back | `Alt + Left` |
| Go Forward | `Alt + Right` |
| Go to File | `Ctrl + P` |
| Next Problem | `F8` |
| Previous Problem | `Shift + F8` |
| Split Editor | `Ctrl + \` |
| Close Editor | `Ctrl + W` |
| Switch Editor Group 1 | `Ctrl + 1` |
| Switch Editor Group 2 | `Ctrl + 2` |
| Switch Editor Group 3 | `Ctrl + 3` |
| Toggle Sidebar | `Ctrl + B` |
| Toggle Panel | `Ctrl + J` |
| Toggle Terminal | `` Ctrl + ` `` |
| Toggle Output | `Ctrl + Shift + U` |
| Toggle Problems | `Ctrl + Shift + M` |
| Toggle Debug Console | `Ctrl + Shift + Y` |
| Focus Explorer | `Ctrl + Shift + E` |
| Focus Search | `Ctrl + Shift + F` |
| Focus Source Control | `Ctrl + Shift + G` |
| Focus Extensions | `Ctrl + Shift + X` |
| Focus Terminal | `` Ctrl + ` `` |

## Terminal

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| New Terminal | `` Ctrl + Shift + ` `` |
| Kill Terminal | `Ctrl + Shift + K` (when focused) |
| Run Selected Text | `Shift + Enter` |
| Clear Terminal | `Ctrl + K` (when focused) |

## Debugging

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Start Debugging | `F5` |
| Stop Debugging | `Shift + F5` |
| Restart Debugging | `Ctrl + Shift + F5` |
| Toggle Breakpoint | `F9` |
| Step Over | `F10` |
| Step Into | `F11` |
| Step Out | `Shift + F11` |
| Continue | `F5` |
| Show Hover | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + I` |

## Multi-cursor

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Add Cursor Below | `Ctrl + Alt + Down` |
| Add Cursor Above | `Ctrl + Alt + Up` |
| Add Next Match | `Ctrl + D` |
| Skip and Add Next Match | `Ctrl + K, D` |
| Add All Matches | `Ctrl + Shift + L` |
| Undo Last Cursor | `Ctrl + U` |
| Insert Cursor at End of Each Line Selected | `Shift + Alt + I` |

## Search and Replace

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Find | `Ctrl + F` |
| Find Next | `F3` |
| Find Previous | `Shift + F3` |
| Replace | `Ctrl + H` |
| Replace Next | `Ctrl + Shift + 1` |
| Replace All | `Ctrl + Alt + Enter` |
| Find in Files | `Ctrl + Shift + F` |
| Replace in Files | `Ctrl + Shift + H` |
| Toggle Match Case | `Alt + C` |
| Toggle Regex | `Alt + R` |
| Toggle Whole Word | `Alt + W` |

## IntelliSense

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Trigger Suggest | `Ctrl + Space` |
| Trigger Parameter Hints | `Ctrl + Shift + Space` |
| Quick Fix | `Ctrl + .` |
| Refactor | `Ctrl + Shift + R` |
| Rename Symbol | `F2` |

## File Explorer

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| New File | `Ctrl + N` |
| New Folder | `Ctrl + Shift + N` |
| Reveal Active File in Explorer | `Ctrl + K, R` |
| Open Active File in New Window | `Ctrl + K, O` |
| Compare Active File with Saved | `Ctrl + K, D` |

## Source Control

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Focus Source Control | `Ctrl + Shift + G` |
| Stage Selected Ranges | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + Alt + S` |
| Unstage Selected Ranges | `Ctrl + K, U` |
| Open Changes | `Ctrl + K, Ctrl + F` |

## Extensions

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Focus Extensions | `Ctrl + Shift + X` |
| Install from VSIX | `Ctrl + Shift + X` → click menu |

## Markdown

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Toggle Preview | `Ctrl + Shift + V` |
| Toggle Side Preview | `Ctrl + K, V` |

## Emmet

| Action | Shortcut |
|--------|----------|
| Expand Abbreviation | `Tab` |
| Wrap with Abbreviation | `Ctrl + Shift + A` |
| Remove Tag | `Ctrl + K, T` |
| Update Image Size | `Ctrl + Shift + I` |
| Evaluate Math Expression | `Ctrl + Shift + Y` |
| Increment by 1 | `Ctrl + Up` |
| Decrement by 1 | `Ctrl + Down` |
| Increment by 10 | `Alt + Up` |
| Decrement by 10 | `Alt + Down` |

> **Note:** Comma-separated shortcuts like `Ctrl + K, S` mean press `Ctrl+K` first, release, then press `S`.
